msgctxt "64"
msgid "...Oh, is that right? So you've been abroad this whole time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Yeah... Somewhere real far. I only came back to Kamurocho because... Well, "
"let's just say I wanted to pay a special  visit to a special someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Well, hello, boys. Nice of you to show up. If you're looking for "
"Haruka-chan, she's in the back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "He a new customer? Haven't seen him around before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Yes, he says he's been overseas. Apparently there's someone in Kamurocho he "
"came back to visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "...Is everything all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Oh, uh... I was wondering if I could speak with you a moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Why so formal all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "I'll take the check... Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Sure, hon. Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr ""

